---
import Base from '../../../../layouts/Base.astro';

// /metadax/guide/share/ -- share a generic sample through the "Share a sample"
// issue template. Names out first; a person reviews before anything appears.
// Tracks the skill's Step 3 and .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/share-a-sample.yml.
---
<Base title="Share a Meta DAX sample" description="Offer a generic version of your lesson — made-up names, nothing identifying — to help the next family. A person reviews each one before it appears in the library." wide>
  <section class="lede">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/metadax/">Meta DAX</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/metadax/guide/">Help</a> &rsaquo; Share a sample</p>
    <h1>Share a sample</h1>
    <p class="lede-text">
      If a lesson helped you, a generic version of it can help the next family with
      the same stuck spot. Sharing is your choice, it is never automatic, and a
      person reviews every one before it appears.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-make">
    <h2 id="h-make">1. Make the generic version</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Ask the skill (or your AI chat) to make a generic version you could share. It
      writes two small files: <code>sample.md</code> (the lesson written for another
      guide) and <code>entry.json</code> (one line for the library index). It
      invents fresh, made-up names &mdash; not the nickname you used &mdash; and
      strips every identifying detail, keeping only the teaching.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-names">
    <h2 id="h-names">2. Take the names out first</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Before you post anything, read it through and confirm:
    </p>
    <ul class="plain">
      <li>made-up names only &mdash; no real name, school, town, birth date, email, phone or photo;</li>
      <li>no diagnosis or condition named anywhere &mdash; the stuck point is described as behaviour;</li>
      <li>the &ldquo;a way, never the way&rdquo; line is present.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="block" aria-labelledby="h-post">
    <h2 id="h-post">3. Post it with the form</h2>
    <p class="body">
      Open the <strong>&ldquo;Share a sample&rdquo;</strong> form and paste
      <code>sample.md</code> and <code>entry.json</code> into the two boxes, then
      tick the three confirmations. There is no upload and no account.
    </p>
    <p class="out"><a href="https://github.com/daxfoundation/metadax/issues/new?template=share-a-sample.yml">Open the &ldquo;Share a sample&rdquo; form &rarr;</a></p>
    <p class="body">
      A reviewer reads it, and if it is clear of anything identifying, publishes it
      into the library and adds the index line. Then the next parent with the same
      stuck spot gets a head start.
    </p>
    <p class="out">
      <a href="/metadax/samples/">Browse the sample library &rarr;</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/faq/">Questions and answers</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/metadax/guide/">Back to the guide</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede { padding-block: 3rem 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .eyebrow a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .eyebrow a:hover, .eyebrow a:focus-visible { color: var(--fg); }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.6vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.22; letter-spacing: -0.012em; max-width: 20em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .lede-text { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }

  .block { padding-block: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  h2 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg); }
  .body { margin: 0; max-width: 40em; color: #cfcfcf; }
  .body + .body, .body + .out, .out + .body, .body + .plain, .plain + .body { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .body a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .body a:hover, .body a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
  .plain { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; max-width: 42em; color: #cfcfcf; }
  .plain li + li { margin-top: 0.5rem; }

  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 8%, transparent); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; }

  .out { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; font-size: 0.9375rem; }
  .out span { color: var(--faint); margin-inline: 0.5rem; }
  .out a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--faint); }
  .out a:hover, .out a:focus-visible { border-bottom-color: currentColor; }
</style>
